    "problems": "No uncertainty estimates are reported. The study reports test accuracy/AP but not training error, so it does not quantify a generalization gap. The text does not provide results for the mentioned CIFAR datasets or Resnet-152. Some method and dataset details are unclear: Craigslist is described as a migration-learning test set, while the tables label the metric AP.",
